step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a robust mean combination on the full pool to establish a baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over the plain mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it improves over mean and weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming outliers improves over the weighted inverse-error baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle on the full pool to see if a learned meta‑weighting improves over inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a DBA (Dynamic Bayesian Average) on the full model pool to see if it can beat the current trimmed mean leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on a smaller, high‑performing pool (pool1) using inverse_error to see if focusing on top models improves over DBA on full pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a slightly larger pool improves over pool1 weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller pool1 to see if reducing model set improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","models":["THETA","rf","FT_rf","FT_catboost","NaiveMovingAverage"]}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool2 to see if reducing model set to the top 7 improves over weighted and dba.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Try a weighted combination on pool1 using softmax_neg_error to see if a different weighting improves over inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool1 using the error_trend weighting to see if trend-aware weights improve over inverse_error.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["THETA","rf","FT_rf","FT_catboost","NaiveMovingAverage"],"weights":"error_trend"}

